==Etymology==
"Ditto" is a word that means "the same thing again", referencing Ditto's self-duplication ability.

==Trivia==
*According to Ben's fansites on the [[Extranet]], Ditto is his cutest alien.<ref>''[[Hot Stretch]]''</ref>{{Refn|[[:File:Ditto Cutest Alien Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Ditto and [[Wildvine (Classic)|Wildvine]] are the only aliens to be manually (and accidentally) unlocked by [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]].
*If Ben were to use Ditto with [[Skurd]] attached to the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]], only the original Ditto would have Skurd.{{Refn|[[:File:SkurdDitto.png]]|group = DJW}} If all the clones had to use Skurd's power, they would have to remain huddled together.{{Refn|[[:File:Skurd Ditto and Echo Echo.png]]|group = DJW}}
*If [[Ben 23]] had a counterpart to Ditto in his [[Hero Watch|Omnitrix]] he would name him Copy Copy 2.{{Refn|[[:File:Copy Copy 2 Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Ditto's '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''' design was made by [[Thomas N. Perkins IV]].{{Refn|[[:File:Tom Designed Ditto & Mutant Lepidopterrans.PNG]]|group = TNP}}{{Refn|[[:File:Tom Designed S3 & S4 Characters.png]]|group = TNP}}
*The first design he made was approved as the crew was very busy when Ditto was conceived during development.{{Refn|[[:File:Way Big and Ditto No Prototypes.PNG]]|group = TNP}} The only difference is that his fins were changed from white to black.{{Refn|[[:File:Ditto OS Concept Art.png]]|group = ca}}
*Although Ditto's design bears a resemblance to Yakko Warner from '''[[Wikipedia:Animaniacs|Animaniacs]]''' (who coincidentally is also voiced by [[Rob Paulsen]]), Thomas did not give a single thought to the Animaniacs when designing him.{{Refn|[[:File:Ditto's Design Not an Animaniacs Reference.png]]|group = TNP}} He was not based on anything in particular.{{Refn|[[:File:Ditto not based on anything particular.png]]|group = TNP}}
*Ditto's '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' designs were made by [[Derrick J. Wyatt]].{{Refn|[[:File:Some of the Aliens Designed by Derrick in OV.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Ditto's design in '''Omniverse''' has some elements of the [[w:c:pikmin:Pikmin family|Pikmin]] from the [[w:c:pikmin:Pikmin series|eponymous Nintendo series]].{{Refn|[[:File:OV Ditto Pikmin Elements.png]]|group = DJW}}

